00:55:20,585 --> 00:55:22,625
-Whoa.
-Wow.

806
00:55:22,705 --> 00:55:24,585
I basically paraphrased what you said.

807
00:55:24,665 --> 00:55:26,145
No, you said it well.

808
00:55:26,665 --> 00:55:27,665
Really?

809
00:55:28,185 --> 00:55:30,105
Okay. You're so cute.

810
00:55:35,185 --> 00:55:36,425
Can I take a picture of you two?

811
00:55:37,785 --> 00:55:38,785
-Sure.
-Come on.

812
00:55:38,865 --> 00:55:39,905
Here, let me.

813
00:55:44,545 --> 00:55:45,705
What are you doing?

814
00:55:46,785 --> 00:55:47,785
Taking their picture.

815
00:55:50,065 --> 00:55:51,745
Then we can show it at their wedding.

816
00:55:52,505 --> 00:55:53,585
Won't there be a whole album?

817
00:56:03,545 --> 00:56:04,385
Hey,

818
00:56:05,025 --> 00:56:05,945
why'd you take that?

819
00:56:06,025 --> 00:56:08,465
To show at our wedding?

820
00:56:14,505 --> 00:56:15,865
Wanna go behind the school?

821
00:56:18,145 --> 00:56:19,905
Let's get something to eat
for the new semester.

822
00:56:23,665 --> 00:56:24,785
You're weirdly quiet.

823
00:56:25,385 --> 00:56:26,745
What got into you?

824
00:56:28,345 --> 00:56:29,785
I was just thinking about something.

825
00:56:30,785 --> 00:56:32,945
Think we'll still be together
in 12th grade?

826
00:56:33,465 --> 00:56:34,865
Or will it be like Proud said?

827
00:56:35,705 --> 00:56:37,705
We're together today,
but we might break up someday.

828
00:56:42,945 --> 00:56:43,865
Oh, right.

829
00:56:57,585 --> 00:56:58,705
It's beautiful.

830
00:56:59,225 --> 00:57:00,585
When did you secretly get this made?

831
00:57:02,145 --> 00:57:04,105
I was gonna give it
to you on our anniversary,

832
00:57:04,745 --> 00:57:06,985
but then I thought,
I might as well give it to you now.

833
00:57:09,585 --> 00:57:11,025
And,

834
00:57:11,105 --> 00:57:12,785
if you ever want to break up with me,

835
00:57:14,505 --> 00:57:17,145
when that day comes,
I won't let you break up with me.

836
00:57:18,585 --> 00:57:20,665
You're joking around again.

837
00:57:23,465 --> 00:57:24,625
I'm not joking.

838
00:57:25,145 --> 00:57:26,345
I'm serious.

839
00:57:27,265 --> 00:57:29,465
I haven't really thought
about the future yet.

840
00:57:30,785 --> 00:57:33,345
I just know I have dreams
I want to achieve.

841
00:57:34,145 --> 00:57:35,545
I want to be a musician,

842
00:57:35,625 --> 00:57:36,985
and…

843
00:57:38,705 --> 00:57:39,585
be your boyfriend.

844
00:57:43,665 --> 00:57:45,465
You don't think about the future?

845
00:57:46,585 --> 00:57:48,945
Then my dreams are the same.

846
00:57:49,785 --> 00:57:51,185
To be an esports player

847
00:57:52,585 --> 00:57:53,985
and be your boyfriend.

848
00:57:55,985 --> 00:57:58,145
That's enough to give my life meaning.

849
00:58:21,385 --> 00:58:22,745
Hey!

850
00:58:22,825 --> 00:58:24,865
We're back!

851
00:58:24,945 --> 00:58:26,545
Let's go get something to eat.

852
00:58:34,505 --> 00:58:37,145
I thought my life at
a former all-girls school

853
00:58:37,665 --> 00:58:39,185
would be impossible.

854
00:58:40,265 --> 00:58:41,945
-LeeIth.
-Hello.

855
00:58:42,025 --> 00:58:44,185
I thought my mom had taken
my teenage years away.

856
00:58:44,945 --> 00:58:47,185
But actually, it wasn't bad at all.

857
00:58:49,025 --> 00:58:50,545
-Man, you're so slow.
-Let's go.

858
00:58:50,625 --> 00:58:52,265
Hello!

859
00:58:52,825 --> 00:58:55,785
Coming to a new school
and trying new things

860
00:58:55,865 --> 00:58:59,225
gave me great opportunities,
great friends, and great love.

861
00:59:00,225 --> 00:59:02,625
Maybe that's all teenage life needs.

862
00:59:22,145 --> 00:59:24,265
IF YOU HAVE A PROBLEM WITH A RULE,
TAKE IT TO COURT. DON'T TELL ME.

